on, active manifest, visual ledger, predecessor receipt, and compact readback\n- adds seven reusable P6-03 ProcedureModels and reuses the exact P5 combined-events model for three repeated-event instances\n- records 129 approved score parts, 43 instruction-only abstentions, 173 ProcedureInstances, 36 ordered composite chains, and 13 reviewed alternative MS routes\n- keeps definite integration and algebra as application steps, with zero incidental supporting-method promotions\n\n## Custody and gates\n\n- P6 denominator: 286 questions / 920 QuestionParts, PASS\n- approved without QP review: 0\n- approved score parts without MS review: 0\n- graph/layout inferred without pixels: 0\n- support/piecewise mismatch accepted: 0\n- invalid density normalization accepted: 0\n- candidate exposed as approved: 0\n- singleton models without rationale: 0 (no new singleton models)\n- duplicate identities, shared models, dangling refs, structural orphans: 0\n- historical P6-01/P6-02 byte changes: 0\n- remote writes by producer: 0\n- visual minutes: not separately instrumented; no duration inferred\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1801_p6_continuous_random_variables_semantic_kg.test.py` — 9/9 PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1766_future_semantic_kg_producer.test.py` — 31/31 PASS\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1767_future_semantic_kg_harness.test.py` — 27/27 PASS\n- `python3 -m py_compile ...` — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n- `npm run lint:changed` — PASS\n- deterministic producer rematerialization — PASS with byte-identical outputs\n\nThe inherited P6-02 suite passes 12/14 after successor materialization; its two active-output assertions intentionally expect cumulative v2/P6-02 and therefore do not apply once the valid P6-03 cumulative v3 successor is active. Immutable P6-02 shard bytes remain pinned and unchanged.\n","created_at":"2026-07-31T13:21:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T14:25:45Z","closed_at":"2026-07-31T13:28:41Z","merged_a